        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By playing with this VR application, you can learn the techniques of Kendama, a traditional Japanese toy. There are two types of techniques that can be learned: “Moshikame” and “Tsubame-gaeshi”. If you practice these techniques in the app, you will be able to do them in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the VR world, you practice in an environment where the ball moves slowly and then gradually becomes faster. The system supports smooth progress with fewer stumbles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please practice Kendama while following the model moves that appear in front of you, and then try actual Kendama in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Warning】</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This app is only compatible with Quest.</strong><br><strong>Please note that other devices may cause hand orientation or malfunction.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By playing with this VR application, you can learn the techniques of Kendama, a traditional Japanese toy. There are two types of techniques that can be learned: “Moshikame” and “Tsubame-gaeshi”. If you practice these techniques in the app, you will be able to do them in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the VR world, you practice in an environment where the ball moves slowly and then gradually becomes faster. The system supports smooth progress with fewer stumbles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please practice Kendama while following the model moves that appear in front of you, and then try actual Kendama in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Warning】</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This app is only compatible with Quest.</strong><br><strong>Please note that other devices may cause hand orientation or malfunction.</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "This system enables you to play Kendama in the real world by practicing Kendama in the VR world.",
